    <p>The email address on your account was changed away from this one at
      <strong>{{occurredAt}}</strong>. Messages about your account now go to the
      new address.</p>
    <p>If this was you, no action is needed.</p>
    <p style='color: #b00; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 24px;'>If you didn't
      change it, your account may be compromised.</p>
    <p style='color: #666; font-size: 14px;'>Contact support right away so the
      account can be recovered.</p>
  </body>
</html>